Original commit body from a469f63:

Both sections now use the same _is_test_path function for test
classification and SOURCE_EXTENSIONS for file discovery.

Changes:
- _detect_test_summary: Uses SOURCE_EXTENSIONS + _is_test_path
  instead of TEST_FILE_PATTERNS glob matching
- _count_test_loc: Uses SOURCE_EXTENSIONS instead of LANGUAGE_EXTENSIONS
  to exclude config files (Makefile, Cargo.toml) from test counts
- is_test_path: Added tests.py and *_spec.rb patterns

This fixes the contradictory output where Overview showed different
test counts than the Tests section. For example, qemu-keycodemapdb
had Overview showing "6 test files" while Tests section showed
"No test files detected" (now both show 4 test files).
